{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And on the day that the Mishkan was set up</b> — now Scripture returns to narrate the matter of the journeying and the commandments they were commanded concerning it, such as the trumpets concerning which they were now commanded, to be for assembling the congregation and for journeying the camps. And the sense of <b>the cloud covered the Mishkan, the tent of the testimony</b> is to say that the cloud covered only the tent of the testimony, not the courtyard of the Mishkan."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:03:52.539417587Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}